  "solution": "Gọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>x</mi></semantics></math> là chiều rộng của hình hộp chữ nhật (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>), suy ra chiều dài là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>24</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tGiả sử giá thành chất liệu để làm nắp là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>S</mi></semantics></math> trên một đơn vị diện tích. Tổng số tiền để làm hộp là\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>S</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>S</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>144</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>S</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>54</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>S</mi><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tÁp dụng bất đẳng thức AM - GM ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>54</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≥</mo><mn>3</mn><mroot><msup><mn>27</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mroot><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>216</mn><mi>S</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>\n\t\tGiá thành của hộp thấp nhất khi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>27</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⇔</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>24</mn><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tSuy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
